``` HL-0005 - WMI & PsExec-Style Lateral Movement (ATT&CK T1047, T1021.002, T1569.002) ```
``` Platform: Splunk. Sources: Sysmon EventCode 1 and/or Windows Security EventCode 4688 (command-line auditing required) ```
``` Playbook: playbooks/HL-0005-T1047-T1021.002-wmi-psexec-lateral-movement.md ```
``` Adjust index/sourcetype and field names to match your Windows TA / CIM mapping ```
``` Lab dataset: use earliest=0 ```
index=windows (EventCode=1 OR EventCode=4688) earliest=-14d
| eval proc=coalesce(Image, New_Process_Name, NewProcessName),
       cmd=coalesce(CommandLine, Process_Command_Line),
       parent=coalesce(ParentImage, Creator_Process_Name, ParentProcessName),
       acct=coalesce(User, Account_Name, user),
       dest=coalesce(Computer, ComputerName, host)
| rex field=proc "(?<proc_name>[^\\\\]+)$"
| rex field=parent "(?<parent_name>[^\\\\]+)$"
| eval proc_name=lower(proc_name), parent_name=lower(parent_name)
| eval via_wmi=if(parent_name="wmiprvse.exe" AND in(proc_name, "cmd.exe", "powershell.exe", "pwsh.exe", "mshta.exe", "rundll32.exe", "regsvr32.exe", "wscript.exe", "cscript.exe"), 1, 0),
       via_psexec=if(in(parent_name, "psexesvc.exe", "paexec.exe", "csexecsvc.exe", "remcomsvc.exe"), 1, 0)
| where via_wmi=1 OR via_psexec=1
``` SCCM / MECM compliance scripts (\CCM\SystemTemp\) - same exclusion as the Sigma rule; "." stands in for the backslash ```
| where NOT match(cmd, "(?i)CCM.SystemTemp.")
| eval method=if(via_wmi=1, "WMI (WmiPrvSE child)", "PsExec-style service"),
       wmiexec_sig=if(match(cmd, "(?i)127\.0\.0\.1.ADMIN\$.__\d+"), 1, 0)
| stats count AS hits dc(dest) AS hosts min(_time) AS first_seen max(_time) AS last_seen
        values(proc_name) AS children values(dest) AS host_list values(cmd) AS sample_cmds
        BY method parent_name acct wmiexec_sig
| eval host_list=mvindex(host_list, 0, 24), sample_cmds=mvindex(sample_cmds, 0, 9)
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)
``` Rare method/account combinations first; wmiexec_sig=1 is high-confidence on its own ```
| sort 0 hits hosts
``` Pivot: index=windows EventCode=4624 (Logon_Type=3 OR LogonType=3) for the same account on the same host minutes before first_seen ```
``` Pivot: index=windows EventCode=7045 (System log) for PSEXESVC / PAExec / random service names on the same host ```
